  "body": "Found during the work on PR #3142 (#3100).\n\nThe `WRITE_GOLDEN` save of `examples/first-4axis-part.camproj` rewrites fields that drifted on main before #3100: the A-axis feed and travel, `chain_order`, the machine post, and a local absolute model path. PR #3142 took only the 3 stamp values, so the committed file still differs from a fresh `build()` in these fields.\n\nWork:\n1. Find the cause of each difference. A local absolute path must never go into a shipped example.\n2. Regenerate the example by its test's own path, with the `.nc` byte-identical, or fix `build()` so that it gives the committed file.\n",
